{"id":"ef59807ad934771f","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-banach-space.md","title":"Banach Space","display":"df-banach-space — Banach Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-banach-space","aliases":["58-df-banach-space"],"display":"df-banach-space — Banach Space","depends_on":["[[58-df-normed-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-banach-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-banach-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-banach-space — Banach Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bdbbe5a00af04978\" href=\"?note=bdbbe5a00af04978\" title=\"58-df-normed-space\">58-df-normed-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|\\in V\">\\(X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bdbbe5a00af04978\" href=\"?note=bdbbe5a00af04978\" title=\"58-df-normed-space\">58-df-normed-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Banach}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V^2\\cup V\">\\(\\mathrm{Banach}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V^2\\cup V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}banach\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\land\\forall x_\\bullet\\in X^\\omega\\;\\left(\\left[\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m\\geq N\\land n\\geq N\\to\\|x_m-x_n\\|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\right]\\to\\exists x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n\\geq N\\to\\|x_n-x\\|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}banach\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\land\\forall x_\\bullet\\in X^\\omega\\;\\left(\\left[\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m\\geq N\\land n\\geq N\\to\\|x_m-x_n\\|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\right]\\to\\exists x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n\\geq N\\to\\|x_n-x\\|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}banach\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow\\exists K,+,\\cdot\\;\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}banach\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow\\exists K,+,\\cdot\\;\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}banach\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{Banach}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|\\;\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}banach\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{Banach}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|\\;\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Banach spaces are complete normed spaces.</li>\n<li>They are the setting for functional analysis.</li>\n<li>The binary and unary compatibility forms existentially hide only the omitted structure components.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-normed-space","status":"resolved","id":"bdbbe5a00af04978","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-normed-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-normed-space","status":"resolved","id":"bdbbe5a00af04978","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-normed-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Banach}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V^2\\cup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}banach\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\land\\forall x_\\bullet\\in X^\\omega\\;\\left(\\left[\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m\\geq N\\land n\\geq N\\to\\|x_m-x_n\\|<\\varepsilon)\\right]\\to\\exists x\\in X\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n\\geq N\\to\\|x_n-x\\|<\\varepsilon)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}banach\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow\\exists K,+,\\cdot\\;\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,K,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)","display":true},{"tex":"\\